WEBVTT

00:10:27.346 --> 00:10:30.950
and simply put it on the pile of pages.

00:10:30.974 --> 00:10:33.510
So you take a piece,
you just put it on the side.

00:10:33.534 --> 00:10:34.859
In the third condition,

00:10:34.883 --> 00:10:37.226
the experimenter got the sheet of paper,

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:39.732
and put it directly into a shredder.

00:10:39.756 --> 00:10:41.756
(Laughter)

00:10:43.177 --> 00:10:45.970
What happened in those three conditions?

00:10:45.994 --> 00:10:50.196
In this plot I'm showing you
at what pay rate people stopped.

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:52.802
So low numbers mean
that people worked harder.

00:10:52.826 --> 00:10:54.928
They worked for much longer.

00:10:54.952 --> 00:10:56.506
In the acknowledged condition,

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:59.630
people worked all the way
down to 15 cents.

00:10:59.654 --> 00:11:01.271
At 15 cents per page,